<tr><td>AmbaFlex</td><td>Belt spirals in wide, mass-flow, and narrow multi-belt versions</td><td>Cartons, trays, bottle packs, bags, totes, loose bottles and cans</td><td>Commonly 15 m (50 ft) per drive on SV, 6 m (20 ft) on SVm</td></tr>
<tr><td>Dorner</td><td>Flexible plastic chain helix</td><td>No product list. Names accumulation, buffering, and cooling uses</td><td>4 tiers, 1,400 mm diameter, 3,450 mm outfeed height</td></tr>
<tr><td>FlexLink</td><td>Plastic top chain on a steel chain base</td><td>Parcels, totes, bottle packs, cartons</td><td>585 mm diameter, 2,900 mm lift (Compact Spiral)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Multi-Conveyor</td><td>Center drum drive, one continuous belt</td><td>Packaged products needing accumulation time</td><td>Designed to order, no published limits</td></tr>
<tr><td>Nercon</td><td>Table-top chain spiral, plus an edge-driven washdown spiral</td><td>Pies, trays, small packages, boxes, plastic containers</td><td>150 FPM, 3-1/4 to 15 inch belt, 48 or 60 inch centerline</td></tr>
<tr><td>Ryson</td><td>Slats on a steel roller chain, single drive</td><td>Cases, totes, small cartons, bottles, cans, jars</td><td>1,800 lbs (case), 3,600 lbs and 200 FPM (High Capacity)</td></tr>
